            "review_title": "Review at Bò 33 Món Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Judy W\nToronto, Canada22 contributions\n0\nAuthentic, Unique, and Absolutely Delicious!\nJan 2016 • Friends\nThis restaurant had stood out for me the most while I travelled all around Vietnam. We ordered the dish called Bo 5 Mon with five different types of beef with rice paper and vegetables for garnishing. It was so delicious, I was looking all over for a place like it in Toronto (success!). Perfect for travellers who like to show new friends a new gem place. A must repeat for sure and I'll be repeating the week of August 20, 2016. I CANNOT WAIT!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 5, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
