            "review_title": "Review at Bò 33 Món Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Samie D\nHanoi, Vietnam66 contributions\n0\nGreat service, amazing food\nApr 2015 • Couples\nWe were so happy our friend brought us here for dinner. The menu has something for everyone and it made it almost impossible to choose one thing! We tried the spring rolls, which were incredible. The manager came up to make sure we could understand what was in all of the food (even though the menu is English, sometimes it's hard to know what dishes are what!) and he ensured we had 10/10 service.\n\nThe meal was delicious and so well priced. The atmosphere is romantic, clean, and has a nice vibe. We can't wait to eat here again and again!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 22, 2015",
