            "review_title": "Review at Bò 33 Món Restaurant",
            "review_text": "LukeHirsch\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nExcellent on all counts, and well-priced.\nApr 2015 • Friends\nThe food was very flavourful and uniquely done, and the prices were excellent. We tried their fresh spring rolls, and followed with beef noodles and a beef with rice paper dish. Everything tasted delicious, and the table service wasn't lacking.\n\nWhat made the meal most enjoyable was the owner who explained his dishes, made recommendations, and gave us a tour of the restaurant and wine cellar. I would highly recommend this to anyone looking to try local cuisine done well.\nRead more\nWritten April 5, 2015",
