            "review_text": "Angela M\nSan Francisco, California1 contribution\n0\nOne of our favorite meals on our trip.\nJul 2014 • Friends\nWe were recommended this restaurant by a local friend on our trip to Vietnam last summer and it was definitely one of our favorite meals out of the entire trip. We were lucky enough to eat in their special, private wine cellar room. The staff was very friendly and welcoming, wine was great (lots of good options), and the food was great. Definitely not a place most tourists go to so it was fantastic to dine somewhere aside from the tourist scene. Overall great experience at this restaurant and would highly recommend.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 8, 2015",
